---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
import PubsLister from "../../components/PubsLister.astro";
---

<Page
  title="Tom Arney's research"
  description="A list of my published work and talks I've given at conferences."
>
  <main>
    <h1>Research</h1>

    <p>
      I enjoy making the invisible visible: exposing the very different origins
      of two mineral grains which look identical to the naked eye, or revealing
      intricate compositional patterns hidden within the plain white inside of a
      coral reef.
    </p>
    <p>
      That this can also reveal information of real importance about the
      environment, past climates, or the formation of the Earth itself is even
      better.
    </p>
    <p>
      Micro-scale images and geochemical maps of natural materials are
      inherently fascinating, but I also like to make the derived data and
      visualisations as intuitive and good-looking as I can.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2 id="methods">Methods & analytical experience</h2>
      <h3>
        Microanalytical methods and instrumentation
      </h3>
      <p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            High-resolution LA-ICP-MS for major and trace element analysis,
            including mapping
          </li>
          <li>
            Laser ablation multi-collector ICP-MS and tandem mass spectrometry
            for in-situ isotopic systems (Pb isotopes and Rb/Sr geochronology)
          </li>
          <li>
            Scanning electron microscopy (BSE imaging, EDS compositional
            screening)
          </li>
          <li>
            Sample preparation for microanalysis, including picking, embedding,
            and polishing
          </li>
        </ul>
      </p>

      <h3>Software and data analysis</h3>
      <p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Developed a flexible LA-ICP-MS <a
              href="https://github.com/tomarney/repeated-ratio-regressions-DRS"
              >data reduction plugin</a
            > for iolite
          </li>
          <li>
            Created semi-automated python workflows for data processing and
            visualization (python and R)
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/BritishGeologicalSurvey/tactool/pull/15"
              >Contributing</a
            > to <a href="https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-docs/pull/6682"
              >open-source projects</a
            > and <a
              href="https://github.com/tomarney/coupled-Pb-Rb-Sr-inverse-provenance"
              >sharing code</a
            > with the scientific community
          </li>
        </ul>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Publications</h2>

      <PubsLister typeFilter="Article|Thesis" />

      <h2>Talks</h2>

      <PubsLister typeFilter="Talk" />
    </section>
  </main>
</Page>
